  m_text: "Once a year a group of drunken scientist gather to hold the Mouse Maze
    Olympics and hold bets. \n\nPlay as a mouse that is placed in a maze and forced
    to retrieve the Big Cheeses in a limited amount of time. \n\nWill you make it
    in time? Or will you... die from hunger? Will these scientists ever go to jail
    for animal cruelty?  Find out!"
